Haejiz
$cards
DECK 2 {SPADES, HEARTS, CLUBS, DIAMONDS}

$initial
DRAW 94 DEAL NOSE
NOSE 6 FACE_ALL
NOSE 4 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST

$moves
MOVE_STACK NOSE NOSE
SRCSTACK Suit match_color
DRAW
PILE ANY NOSE Size > 0
$win
OR
    AND
        PILE ALL DRAW Empty
        PILE ALL DRAW Empty
    PILE ALL DRAW Empty
